WEBVTT

00:14.680 --> 00:19.180
<b><i>My hero, the legendary hit man</i>
<i>Mr. Sakamoto,</i></b>

00:19.260 --> 00:21.680
<b><i>fell in love</i>
<i>and retired from his life of crime.</i></b>

00:23.440 --> 00:28.650
<b><i>All he wanted was the quiet warmth</i>
<i>of living a normal life.</i></b>

00:29.360 --> 00:34.150
<b><i>But the JAA was relentless,</i>
<i>sending assassin after assassin after him.</i></b>

00:34.240 --> 00:35.490
<b><i>Apparently, someone called Slur</i></b>

00:35.570 --> 00:39.410
<b><i>put a bounty of one billion yen</i>
<i>on Mr. Sakamoto's head.</i></b>

00:39.490 --> 00:40.700
<b><i>Screw them!</i></b>

00:40.790 --> 00:44.870
<b><i>If that wasn't bad enough, Slur brought</i>
<i>a group of violent criminals to Japan</i></b>

00:44.960 --> 00:49.500
<b><i>and is trying to ruin</i>
<i>Mr. Sakamoto's precious normal life.</i></b>

00:50.170 --> 00:52.840
<b><i>But we won't let him get the best of us!</i></b>

00:52.920 --> 00:54.340
<b>LU - SHIN - SAKAMOTO</b>

01:23.120 --> 01:25.040
<b>Please… Let me go!</b>

01:25.120 --> 01:26.290
<b>Why are you after me?</b>

01:27.040 --> 01:28.370
<b>Who the hell are you?!</b>

01:29.000 --> 01:30.670
<b>You look scared.</b>

01:37.630 --> 01:39.220
<b>How cute.</b>

01:41.470 --> 01:42.600
<b>I like you.</b>

01:49.810 --> 01:50.980
<b>Wait…</b>

01:54.190 --> 01:55.150
<b>Was this guy</b>

01:55.740 --> 01:57.240
<b>always so ugly?</b>

01:57.740 --> 02:00.660
<b>He was so cute just now.</b>

02:02.990 --> 02:04.830
<b>I guess nothing's cuter</b>

02:04.910 --> 02:08.670
<b>than that terrified look people get
right before they die.</b>

02:10.210 --> 02:12.460
<b>But every time I see that look,</b>

02:13.420 --> 02:16.170
<b>I get too excited and end up killing them.</b>

02:17.300 --> 02:19.590
<b>I should work on my self-control.</b>

02:20.090 --> 02:21.930
<b>DUMP
DEATH ROW INMATE</b>

02:24.970 --> 02:27.730
<b>This is perfect. Tomorrow's job
will go off without a hitch.</b>

02:30.560 --> 02:31.440
<b>Who's there?!</b>

02:34.020 --> 02:35.730
<b>Wait… What?</b>

02:46.240 --> 02:49.210
<b>I finally understand you now.</b>

02:49.910 --> 02:53.040
<b>It really is
what's on the inside that counts!</b>

02:53.130 --> 02:55.040
<b>Oh?</b>

02:56.590 --> 02:58.840
<b>Volume 7 is missing.</b>

02:59.720 --> 03:01.090
<b>That's not right.</b>

03:01.180 --> 03:03.010
<b>Not right. Not right. Not right.</b>

03:03.090 --> 03:06.470
<b>Not right, not right, not right!</b>

03:08.350 --> 03:09.480
<b>I'll take this.</b>

03:11.440 --> 03:13.100
<b>That'll be 484 yen.</b>

03:15.480 --> 03:16.480
<b>That's better!</b>

03:17.190 --> 03:18.900
<b>APART
DEATH ROW INMATE</b>

03:22.490 --> 03:24.240
<b>I need more…</b>

03:24.740 --> 03:27.540
<b>This isn't nearly enough for me.</b>

03:30.540 --> 03:33.500
<b>Where are those S-rank whatevers?</b>

03:33.580 --> 03:35.130
<b>MINIMALIST
DEATH ROW INMATE</b>

03:36.790 --> 03:37.880
<b>KILLED THREE D-RANKS</b>

03:37.960 --> 03:38.960
<b>I GOT ONE B-RANK</b>

03:39.050 --> 03:40.550
<b>Whoa, whoa!</b>

03:40.630 --> 03:43.050
<b>I know we haven't killed in a while,
but cool your jets.</b>

03:43.130 --> 03:44.050
<b>THAT WAS FAST LOL</b>

03:44.140 --> 03:46.720
<b>Rushing into things is so uncool.</b>

03:47.220 --> 03:49.520
<b>What are you doing? Working?</b>

03:50.020 --> 03:52.640
<b>Yeah. Just go back to bed.</b>

03:53.520 --> 03:54.810
<b>Such a waste.</b>

03:55.400 --> 03:59.690
<b>Knowing their personality, their history,
all their stories is what makes</b>

03:59.780 --> 04:01.360
<b>seeing their ending so exciting.</b>

04:01.440 --> 04:02.450
<b>SAW
DEATH ROW INMATE</b>

04:02.530 --> 04:07.700
<b>Now… Whose ending
would be the most entertaining?</b>

05:41.250 --> 05:43.920
<b><i>Sakamoto, I am entrusting my lady to you.</i></b>

05:44.510 --> 05:47.340
<b><i>I will continue looking into Slur.</i></b>

05:48.010 --> 05:50.550
<b><i>Those death row inmates are out there.</i>
<i>Be careful.</i></b>

05:51.140 --> 05:52.680
<b><i>They murder for the fun of it.</i></b>

05:53.220 --> 05:55.980
<b><i>They're a different breed</i>
<i>from hit men and mafia thugs.</i></b>

05:58.390 --> 06:01.020
<b>I'm surprised Wutang left
without much of a fuss.</b>

06:01.110 --> 06:04.070
<b>Yeah, but that jerk
took all the money we won.</b>

06:04.150 --> 06:04.980
<b>VIDEO RENTALS</b>

06:05.070 --> 06:08.530
<b>First things first.
We need intel on the enemy.</b>

06:12.990 --> 06:14.540
<b>Hello, Mr. Sakamoto.</b>

06:15.120 --> 06:17.580
<b>What can I help you find today?</b>

06:18.160 --> 06:22.250
<b>I want to know about the death row inmate
murders from the other day.</b>

06:22.880 --> 06:25.510
<b>That'll be under "psycho horror."</b>

06:25.590 --> 06:29.010
<b>HUMAN LIZARD - DON'T PLEASE - SLEEPY FISH
MAD SOMMAR - THE SILENCE OF THE GOATS</b>

06:29.090 --> 06:30.970
<b>Oh, this looks good.</b>

06:31.050 --> 06:33.430
<b>Everything here is R-rated.</b>

06:33.510 --> 06:34.600
<b>TECHNICAL CHAINSAW MASSACRE</b>

06:34.680 --> 06:36.310
<b>We need all the intel we can get!</b>

06:36.390 --> 06:38.980
<b>Can I close my eyes if I get scared?</b>

06:39.060 --> 06:41.770
<b>-That'll be 1,083,000 yen.
-You don't get to slack off.</b>

06:41.850 --> 06:43.860
<b>-I really can't do horror…
-Credit.</b>

06:43.940 --> 06:45.320
<b>-You're hopeless.
-Thank you.</b>

06:49.610 --> 06:50.820
<b>Have you heard?</b>

06:50.910 --> 06:55.580
<b>A gang of crooks has been causing trouble
the past few days.</b>

06:55.660 --> 06:59.410
<b>Oh, no. They sound real scary.</b>

06:59.500 --> 07:01.580
<b>Look at you, frothing at the mouth.</b>

07:06.960 --> 07:09.670
<b>Osaragi, this is the wrong way.</b>

07:10.170 --> 07:11.970
<b>I missed the turn.</b>

07:13.510 --> 07:15.300
<b>Let me back up.</b>

07:16.680 --> 07:18.060
<b>All clear!</b>

07:18.140 --> 07:21.020
<b>We're on the highway,
you can't just reverse.</b>

07:21.560 --> 07:24.150
<b>But I must say,
you look good in the driver's seat.</b>

07:27.150 --> 07:28.650
<b>Dammit, Osaragi!</b>

07:28.730 --> 07:30.650
<b>Can't you drive more carefully?</b>

07:31.150 --> 07:32.860
<b>There's a senior citizen in here!</b>

07:33.450 --> 07:35.030
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

07:35.120 --> 07:37.290
<b>Mr. Shishiba made me drive.</b>

07:37.790 --> 07:40.370
<b>Both hands on the wheel, Osaragi.</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:46.460
<b>Anyway, I don't care
if they're on death row or not.</b>

07:46.960 --> 07:49.460
<b>You mess around on our turf,
you're dead meat.</b>

07:49.550 --> 07:50.380
<b>HYO
THE ORDER</b>

07:50.470 --> 07:55.550
<b>That line's from a movie I saw yesterday!
One of the thugs said it before he died.</b>

07:56.140 --> 07:57.560
<b>-You saw it too, Hyo?
-What?</b>

07:57.640 --> 07:58.470
<b>NAGUMO
THE ORDER</b>

07:58.560 --> 08:01.390
<b>Give it a rest, Nagumo. Don't stir him up.</b>

08:01.480 --> 08:02.310
<b>SHISHIBA
THE ORDER</b>

08:02.390 --> 08:03.810
<b>Whatever do you mean?</b>

08:07.320 --> 08:09.780
<b>Osaragi, use your indicator.</b>

08:09.860 --> 08:11.440
<b>I was about to.</b>

08:11.530 --> 08:12.360
<b>OSARAGI
THE ORDER</b>

08:12.450 --> 08:16.320
<b>Well, they may be crazed murderers,
but they're amateurs, aren't they?</b>

08:16.910 --> 08:19.080
<b>What is Slur thinking?</b>

08:19.160 --> 08:20.830
<b>I don't understand one bit.</b>

08:20.910 --> 08:24.250
<b>Without any morals or even a conscience,</b>

08:24.330 --> 08:26.710
<b>when it comes to killing,
they have no brakes.</b>

08:26.790 --> 08:28.840
<b>That might make them tougher
than they seem.</b>

08:28.920 --> 08:31.550
<b>When it comes to killing,
you've got no brakes either.</b>

08:31.630 --> 08:32.630
<b>I do too.</b>

08:39.430 --> 08:40.770
<b>Hey!</b>

08:40.850 --> 08:42.180
<b>Osaragi, get down!</b>

08:56.320 --> 08:59.740
<b>We've got another one here.
A killer with no brakes.</b>

08:59.830 --> 09:02.370
<b>He's got his pedal to the metal.</b>

09:02.450 --> 09:03.960
<b>That's Mr. Takamura for you.</b>

09:05.000 --> 09:06.250
<b>TAKAMURA
THE ORDER</b>

09:06.330 --> 09:08.500
<b>-What was that?
-What happened?</b>

09:09.090 --> 09:11.920
<b>In any case, there are four of them, so…</b>

09:12.000 --> 09:15.010
<b>We have more than enough to take them on.</b>

09:15.090 --> 09:17.720
<b>Mr. Shishiba,
we should eat <i>tonkatsu</i> for good luck.</b>

09:17.800 --> 09:19.680
<b>I forgot how superstitious you are.</b>

09:23.310 --> 09:25.600
<b><i>Get away! Stop it!</i></b>

09:30.060 --> 09:31.980
<b>Hey, he fell asleep!</b>

09:32.070 --> 09:35.570
<b>This isn't scary, it's just gross.</b>

09:59.550 --> 10:02.430
<b>Whoa! That was awesome, Taro!</b>

10:02.510 --> 10:06.060
<b>You caught 99 shots in a row!</b>

10:06.560 --> 10:07.850
<b><i>Missed one.</i></b>

10:08.350 --> 10:10.270
<b>But man,</b>

10:10.940 --> 10:12.900
<b>training with you one-on-one is so fun.</b>

10:12.980 --> 10:15.530
<b>It's like we're real pals!</b>

10:16.190 --> 10:19.700
<b>Heisuke, give me one more shot
while there's no one else around.</b>

10:20.200 --> 10:22.530
<b>You really are amazing, huh, Mr. Sakamoto?</b>

10:22.620 --> 10:24.240
<b>Hey, Shin!</b>

10:24.330 --> 10:27.410
<b>But no matter how hard you train,</b>

10:28.080 --> 10:29.750
<b>if you die, you die.</b>

10:34.710 --> 10:37.050
<b>What do you want, Nagumo?</b>

10:37.970 --> 10:39.880
<b>You saw right through me.</b>

10:39.970 --> 10:44.140
<b>What?! Shin, your vibe is way different
than it was a minute ago.</b>

10:44.220 --> 10:46.060
<b>-I heard, Sakamoto.
-Did you get a makeover?</b>

10:46.140 --> 10:50.140
<b>-You're looking fresh!
-You've been snooping around</b>

10:50.230 --> 10:51.600
<b>about Slur's death row inmates.</b>

10:51.690 --> 10:53.270
<b>What if I was?</b>

10:53.770 --> 10:56.280
<b>The Order is already on it.</b>

10:56.780 --> 10:59.280
<b>Lowly mom-and-pop shop workers
should stay out of it.</b>

10:59.360 --> 11:02.530
<b>No thanks.
Waiting around won't do any good.</b>

11:03.160 --> 11:05.790
<b>I'm giving you this warning as a friend.</b>

11:05.870 --> 11:09.210
<b>You've been ordered to kill them all,
haven't you?</b>

11:09.710 --> 11:12.250
<b>I want information on Slur,</b>

11:12.790 --> 11:15.290
<b>so I need to get to them
before The Order does.</b>

11:15.920 --> 11:17.920
<b>You mean you're going to take them alive?</b>

11:18.420 --> 11:20.170
<b>You're as soft as ever.</b>

11:21.090 --> 11:25.050
<b>Let me clue you in
on what your enemies make of you.</b>

11:29.770 --> 11:30.980
<b>The heck is this?</b>

11:31.640 --> 11:33.100
<b>Rank B.</b>

11:33.190 --> 11:35.230
<b>It means you're easy prey.</b>

11:36.480 --> 11:37.650
<b>In case you're wondering,</b>

11:38.150 --> 11:40.360
<b>they put me at rank S.</b>

11:42.490 --> 11:44.410
<b>SUZUKI
HOME IMPROVEMENT STORE</b>

11:46.990 --> 11:50.540
<b>Aww, this kitty's so cute!</b>

11:50.620 --> 11:52.920
<b>Come on, let's grab what we need
and get out.</b>

11:53.460 --> 11:54.920
<b>What are we buying?</b>

11:55.000 --> 11:57.210
<b>Stuff to fix the shop's exterior.</b>

11:58.000 --> 12:01.760
<b>For some reason,
I keep finding holes in the walls lately.</b>

12:04.300 --> 12:06.220
<b>Just a few more minutes!</b>

12:06.300 --> 12:08.850
<b>What's the big rush?</b>

12:08.930 --> 12:10.810
<b>Wish I could be as carefree as you.</b>

12:12.180 --> 12:14.650
<b>Those dangerous death row inmates
are on the prowl.</b>

12:15.230 --> 12:16.650
<b>You saw the videos yourself.</b>

12:17.190 --> 12:19.650
<b>Mr. Manager is strong, so we'll be fine.</b>

12:19.730 --> 12:21.320
<b>That's not the point…</b>

12:21.820 --> 12:26.030
<b>Seriously, right now we're nothing
but a burden to Mr. Sakamoto.</b>

12:27.030 --> 12:28.950
<b><i>If we want to be by his side,</i></b>

12:29.030 --> 12:30.620
<b><i>we have to get better.</i></b>

12:31.410 --> 12:34.500
<b>We have to get stronger too.</b>

12:36.170 --> 12:37.290
<b>Listen to me!</b>

12:37.380 --> 12:39.670
<b>Would you like to hold one too?</b>

12:40.710 --> 12:41.630
<b>I'm in a hurry.</b>

12:42.630 --> 12:44.510
<b>But look how cute he is!</b>

12:44.590 --> 12:46.680
<b>I'm not interested in dogs!</b>

12:48.470 --> 12:49.760
<b>MOCHI
SHIBA INU</b>

12:52.560 --> 12:54.020
<b>What a cutie you are!</b>

12:56.350 --> 12:58.560
<b>Shin, let's get going already.</b>

12:58.650 --> 13:01.320
<b>Aww, just a few more minutes!</b>

13:03.650 --> 13:07.280
<b>-What's the matter? You need to pee?
-That's not what having to pee looks like!</b>

13:12.040 --> 13:13.500
<b>What's going on?</b>

13:14.660 --> 13:15.790
<b>You idiots.</b>

13:16.420 --> 13:21.300
<b>Not very smart to start howling
when you run into a shady character.</b>

13:21.380 --> 13:24.800
<b>What you should do is tuck your tail
between your legs and run.</b>

13:24.880 --> 13:27.300
<b>Who're you, old man?</b>

13:27.380 --> 13:30.220
<b>I'm ex-military, you know?</b>

13:30.300 --> 13:33.560
<b>I've seen plenty of people bite it
because they made the wrong choice.</b>

13:34.060 --> 13:36.390
<b>Such a shame.</b>

13:36.480 --> 13:39.980
<b>Everyone deserves to have
a dramatic ending.</b>

13:40.560 --> 13:42.650
<b>So I've made some special arrangements</b>

13:42.730 --> 13:46.530
<b>to give everyone a truly moving ending.</b>

13:49.110 --> 13:55.120
<b>First, I'll kill that fatty's
family and friends and make him despair.</b>

13:59.330 --> 14:00.330
<b>Shin!</b>

14:02.960 --> 14:05.420
<b>I hate to waste time
on the side-characters.</b>

14:06.380 --> 14:08.630
<b>It gets boring
if you don't keep the pace up.</b>

14:17.310 --> 14:19.060
<b>Shin, this guy…</b>

14:19.140 --> 14:22.310
<b>Definitely. He's one of
the death row inmates.</b>

14:22.400 --> 14:25.820
<b>Not bad. I thought I cut you clean in two,</b>

14:26.530 --> 14:29.450
<b><i>but you used that crowbar</i>
<i>to block at the last second, huh?</i></b>

14:30.410 --> 14:32.870
<b>Good move, Shin.</b>

14:32.950 --> 14:36.450
<b>Screw you. How do you know my name?</b>

14:36.540 --> 14:39.420
<b>All the targets' info is right here.</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:44.630
<b>The only child of the Lu clan,
Lu Shaotang. Rank C.</b>

14:45.630 --> 14:49.930
<b>Ex-hit man and psychic, Shin. Rank D.</b>

14:52.140 --> 14:54.220
<b>Hey! Wait just one minute!</b>

14:54.310 --> 14:56.810
<b>You mean my rank is lower than Lu's?!</b>

14:56.890 --> 14:58.140
<b>I mean, look.</b>

14:58.230 --> 15:00.770
<b>FYI, D is the second-lowest rank.</b>

15:00.850 --> 15:04.570
<b>How can this be? She's just a drunkard!</b>

15:04.650 --> 15:05.900
<b>Shut up!</b>

15:05.980 --> 15:08.570
<b>Don't get too down in the dumps, Shin.</b>

15:08.650 --> 15:11.910
<b>Everyone gets an ending, even D-ranks.</b>

15:14.370 --> 15:15.530
<b>D, huh.</b>

15:18.000 --> 15:19.250
<b>Hey!</b>

15:19.330 --> 15:21.670
<b><i>I'll go for a clean cut</i>
<i>right through his waist!</i></b>

15:33.010 --> 15:37.470
<b>You can fix my ranking
after I beat you half to death,</b>

15:37.560 --> 15:39.560
<b>you psychotic murder-obsessed bastard!</b>

15:40.100 --> 15:42.600
<b>Hey now, you've hurt my feelings.</b>

15:42.690 --> 15:45.150
<b>You make me sound
like some scary murderer.</b>

15:45.230 --> 15:48.650
<b>Well, you've murdered a bunch of people!</b>

15:48.730 --> 15:51.450
<b>I'm sure everyone I killed appreciated it.</b>

15:51.950 --> 15:54.820
<b>Even in the crappiest movies or comics,</b>

15:54.910 --> 15:58.660
<b>if there's an exciting twist
or a dramatic moment at the end,</b>

15:58.740 --> 16:02.750
<b>you come away feeling entertained,
don't you?</b>

16:02.830 --> 16:04.960
<b>It's the same with people.</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:07.590
<b>I feel bad for the ones
who live a boring life.</b>

16:07.670 --> 16:11.920
<b>So, as a present,
I give them the best ending possible.</b>

16:13.680 --> 16:14.680
<b>Don't worry.</b>

16:16.180 --> 16:20.220
<b>I'll make sure your lives
are super entertaining.</b>

16:21.310 --> 16:23.730
<b><i>What the hell? This guy's thoughts…</i></b>

16:30.940 --> 16:32.400
<b>Are you all right? Lu!</b>

16:33.030 --> 16:33.900
<b>Yeah…</b>

16:35.360 --> 16:37.660
<b>Come on, keep up the good fight.</b>

16:37.740 --> 16:38.870
<b>This is bad!</b>

16:49.290 --> 16:51.670
<b>Can't you tell
where he's about to throw it?!</b>

16:51.760 --> 16:54.220
<b>All I can hear is him thinking "kill"!</b>

16:54.840 --> 16:57.050
<b>We have to find
something to fight back with!</b>

16:57.140 --> 17:00.060
<b>What about a hammer? Or a shovel?</b>

17:02.980 --> 17:04.480
<b>Watch out!</b>

17:09.570 --> 17:12.190
<b>I heard you were a psychic, Shin.</b>

17:12.690 --> 17:16.200
<b>My thoughts right now
are super clear, aren't they?</b>

17:17.360 --> 17:20.200
<b>When there are boring losers like you
in front of me,</b>

17:20.280 --> 17:23.950
<b>all I can think about is killing them.</b>

17:27.120 --> 17:28.880
<b>Get away from Shin!</b>

17:30.340 --> 17:33.880
<b>A nail gun, eh? I like you.</b>

17:34.720 --> 17:36.260
<b>LACQUER SPRAY</b>

17:42.640 --> 17:43.810
<b>Did we get him?</b>

17:46.520 --> 17:48.810
<b>You guys are fun.</b>

17:49.310 --> 17:51.610
<b>The more you struggle,
the more you fight back,</b>

17:51.690 --> 17:55.110
<b>the more moving your endings will be.</b>

17:55.190 --> 17:57.700
<b><i>This guy just won't back down!</i></b>

17:57.780 --> 17:59.700
<b><i>He's beyond tough!</i></b>

18:02.280 --> 18:03.290
<b>NO OPEN FLAMES</b>

18:03.370 --> 18:04.200
<b>Shit--</b>

18:14.630 --> 18:15.670
<b>ETHANOL</b>

18:15.760 --> 18:19.130
<b>It's important
to disinfect your wounds promptly.</b>

18:23.220 --> 18:24.970
<b>Hey… Lu!</b>

18:26.930 --> 18:28.770
<b><i>Did she protect me?</i></b>

18:29.270 --> 18:33.190
<b>I smell… alcohol…</b>

18:33.270 --> 18:35.650
<b><i>Damn it… This is all my fault!</i></b>

18:36.150 --> 18:37.690
<b><i>Because I'm so weak…</i></b>

18:38.200 --> 18:40.030
<b><i>If I don't do something, Lu's gonna die.</i></b>

18:40.530 --> 18:42.830
<b><i>What do I do? What do I do?!</i></b>

18:43.370 --> 18:44.990
<b>SAKAMOTO'S</b>

18:45.080 --> 18:46.290
<b>They've been gone a while.</b>

18:46.370 --> 18:47.960
<b>You mean Shin and Lu?</b>

18:48.460 --> 18:50.290
<b>I'm sure they'll be fine.</b>

18:51.040 --> 18:53.960
<b>I don't know what Shin was like
back in his hit man days,</b>

18:54.460 --> 18:56.300
<b>but he's the best!</b>

18:56.380 --> 18:58.760
<b>I mean, he's your partner, after all!</b>

18:59.300 --> 19:01.470
<b>Sure, he has potential.</b>

19:02.010 --> 19:05.850
<b>But he doesn't have much experience
with real life-or-death combat.</b>

19:06.390 --> 19:08.810
<b>I have a feeling
he still hasn't reached his ceiling.</b>

19:10.810 --> 19:11.730
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

19:12.230 --> 19:13.270
<b>Maybe.</b>

19:13.360 --> 19:15.230
<b>I don't have much experience either.</b>

19:16.400 --> 19:17.780
<b>You're a different story.</b>

19:19.860 --> 19:21.950
<b>I'm disappointed, Shin.</b>

19:22.030 --> 19:23.620
<b>Give me a little more.</b>

19:23.700 --> 19:25.870
<b>Don't you feel like crying?
Or wetting yourself?</b>

19:26.370 --> 19:29.870
<b>That ability you have is fascinating.</b>

19:29.960 --> 19:33.250
<b>Too bad it went to such a boring guy.</b>

19:33.790 --> 19:37.710
<b>I'd love to be able
to peek into your head right now.</b>

19:38.340 --> 19:41.800
<b>What are you thinking about,
here, at the end of your life?</b>

19:42.380 --> 19:46.100
<b>This is your moment.
You've got to make the most of it.</b>

19:48.430 --> 19:50.270
<b>I'm looking forward to what comes next.</b>

19:50.350 --> 19:54.480
<b>Once I kill you two,
Sakamoto's family is next.</b>

19:55.190 --> 19:58.110
<b>I'm interested in Sakamoto.</b>

20:00.240 --> 20:05.160
<b><i>The death of a father</i>
<i>who's lost everything he held dear.</i></b>

20:06.030 --> 20:08.910
<b>That's a perfect ending, don't you think?</b>

20:10.040 --> 20:14.710
<b>I wonder what'll be going through his head
when I kill his whole family.</b>

20:38.150 --> 20:39.230
<b><i>Mr. Sakamoto.</i></b>

20:43.860 --> 20:45.280
<b><i>He dodged it?</i></b>

20:46.070 --> 20:47.070
<b><i>What is this?</i></b>

20:47.570 --> 20:48.990
<b><i>Something feels off…</i></b>

20:52.330 --> 20:53.290
<b><i>What?</i></b>

20:53.870 --> 20:55.000
<b><i>How?</i></b>

20:55.080 --> 20:58.090
<b><i>He stopped me</i>
<i>before I could move my right hand.</i></b>

21:00.590 --> 21:01.800
<b>I can see it.</b>

21:01.880 --> 21:03.260
<b>Your future.</b>

21:14.560 --> 21:16.600
<b><i>What's this kid's deal?</i></b>

21:17.190 --> 21:19.770
<b><i>His vibe is way different</i>
<i>than it was a minute ago.</i></b>

21:25.950 --> 21:27.360
<b><i>Super reflexes…</i></b>

21:29.410 --> 21:32.660
<b><i>No, these aren't reflexes.</i></b>

21:33.250 --> 21:36.500
<b><i>It's like he really can see the future!</i></b>

21:49.340 --> 21:50.890
<b>I should thank you.</b>

21:52.180 --> 21:55.390
<b>When I was struggling
to block out your incessant thoughts,</b>

21:55.890 --> 21:58.230
<b>I found a new skill deep within myself.</b>

21:59.900 --> 22:03.690
<b>I won't let you hurt
the people I care about!</b>

23:32.450 --> 23:37.450
<b>Subtitle translation by: Joshua Kizuki</b>
